      <TITLE>5.5.9.9.6. Motivation: Why is the 1/2 in the Model?</TITLE>
   </HEAD>
   <BODY BGCOLOR="FFFFCC">
	<IMG SRC="../../gifs/nvgtbr.gif" BORDER=0 VALIGN="TOP" ISMAP USEMAP="#MenuBar">
   <map name="MenuBar">
